<title>FRANCE: Axa, UAP create &quot;unrivalled&quot; group.</title>
<headline>Axa, UAP create &quot;unrivalled&quot; group.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurers Axa and UAP issued a joint statement on Tuesday confirming alliance plans announced minutes earlier by a UAP spokesman and saying they would create a group with an &quot;unrivalled strategic position&quot;.</p>
<p>The brief statement did not give any further details of the alliance but said the plan would be submitted to the boards of the two groups on Tuesday and the firms had requested suspension of their shares on the Paris stock exchange.</p>
<p>Staff representative bodies would also be consulted, the joint statement said.</p>
</text>
